WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-How are you?

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Still alive.
-Still alive.

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.771 size:84% position:42%
And thriving. Thriving.
-Thriving. You know.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.607
-54! You just turned --
You had your birthday yesterday!

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:09.442 size:84% position:42%
-Thanks for that. Yes.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.880
-I would have -- You don't
want to say someone's age,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you actually had
a Studio 54-themed party.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:18.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did, last night.
I did 54, yeah.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And this is --
As you would assume,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.857
Alan Cumming has a very
laid-back birthday party,

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.258 size:81% position:41% line:92%
just like any of us...

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:28.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
with what looks like
a real fire hazard of a cake.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.730 size:78% position:39%
-That was terrifying.
-That was terrifying.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.432 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That really was.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.768 line:92%
I'm feinting comfort there,

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:36.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I was actually
a little scared.

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:38.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
This was in this really great
place actually.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.041 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's a water tower, a bar
in Williamsburg

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.376 size:84% position:42%
in this hotel called
the Williamsburg Hotel.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.477 size:88% position:44% line:92%
It's an old water tower,

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it's big enough
for you to be -- Oh. Yeah.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is inside a water tower.
-That's fantastic.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's no water anymore,
obviously.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, obviously. You couldn't
have a cake like that

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.120 line:92%
in a water tower with water.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then you ended up at --
You have a bar.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
At my bar. Club Cumming.
-Club Cumming.

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's the after party.
-There you go.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:04.431
And you won -- Club Cumming is
an award-winning establishment.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:05.698 line:92%
-It just won -- [ Laughs ]

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:09.602
It won the Best Bar at the Glam
Awards a couple of weeks ago,

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.537 size:78% position:39% line:92%
which is so exciting.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did I not tell you?
-That's really exciting!

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
At the end of the night
like that,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.643 line:92%
do you end up behind the bar?

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you serving people drinks?
-Yes.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:21.247
I usually go -- I usually go --
Like, it's quite a fun place

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
to be behind the bar
seeing to all the bar people.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.453
And also it keeps you kind of
a wee distance from everybody.

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:29.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you can fill
your own drinks.

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:29.989 line:92%
But I know -- And I enjoy --

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:32.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I take people's orders,
and I do, you know --

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.395 size:84% position:42%
I love doing the thing,
the little computer --

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.162 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
ding, ding, ding.

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:41.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm very -- I actually use
my well-known-ness

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
to cover up my bad
bartending skills.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.874
People will say stuff like, "Oh,
can I have a tequila sunrise?"

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:50.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go,
"How about a tequila soda?"

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.178 line:92%
"Can I have an old-fashioned?"

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like,
"How about a vodka soda?

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.380 line:92%
What would that be like?"

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.785
I just can't -- I don't pretend
that I'm -- I don't want to.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:01.754 size:78% position:39%
And also it's better
to have a soda drink.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:04.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't want any of those
sugary, yucky things.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:04.958 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-No, and I will say,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
no matter how much
you want an old-fashioned,

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
you don't want one
made by somebody

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:11.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
who doesn't know how to do it.
-Mine would be terrible.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.433 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I once gave someone --

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:18.204
Instead of a Jack and Coke,
because the gun thing --

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.072 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's got "C."

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
I maybe had been
drinking myself,

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:23.076 size:78% position:39%
because the cranberry
is cranberry-colored.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the Coke one isn't.
It's just white.

00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:27.147 line:92%
I got confused with the two C's,

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I gave them
a Jack and cranberry.

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.650 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah. And that --

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.720 size:81% position:41%
I think when you get
a Jack and Coke wrong,

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.888 size:88% position:44% line:92%
that has really told you

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.923 size:81% position:41%
what kind of bartender
you're dealing with.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.825 line:92%
-You'd better be owning the bar.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause they say
that's a slam dunk.

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's day one
of bartender school.

00:02:42.495 --> 00:02:44.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Exactly, yeah.
-You have --

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:47.467
Your new show coming up,
going to previews, "Daddy."

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:47.901 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:47.901 --> 00:02:50.503 size:84% position:42%
-Very exciting any time
you start a new show.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:53.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm assuming there are
a degree of nerves.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.274 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:58.044
-You also -- This is a show
with a great deal of nudity.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:01.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There is a lot of nudity
of myself

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.782
and that young gentleman there,
Ronald Peet.

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:05.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
We are naked.
It's an incredible play.

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:07.587 size:84% position:42%
It's this new, young
African-American writer

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:10.390
called Jeremy O. Harris, who
wrote a play called "Slave Play"

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.257 line:92%
that was on a theater workshop.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:15.028
And this is another kind of
expedition of, you know,

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:19.365
race and queerness and
intergenerational things.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:22.202 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughs ] And so I --

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:24.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's a swimming pool
on stage.

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:27.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm, like, an arts collector
in Los Angeles.

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.142
And I'm very rich.
And I have a big, swanky house.

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:33.713
So, there's a pool, and a lot of
the time I am naked in the pool.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:37.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel bad because
of the way I asked that.

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, this is
an intelligently written play

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:42.255 line:92%
that deals with heavy themes.

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:45.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "So, uh, yeah.
So I heard you're naked."

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.894 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
-So I apologize.

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:49.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
Particularly
to the writer of this work

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:51.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
that that's where I went
immediately.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:56.603
-But the thing I think about
nudity is actually sustained --

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I think
if you're going to do it,

00:03:58.104 --> 00:04:00.573
especially with this play
which is about really important

00:04:00.573 --> 00:04:03.309
discussions about things that
I think should be talked about

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.912
and we're not talking about them
in this country enough,

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:06.913 line:92%
to do with race and things.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:10.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, you know, the nakedness,
I think you can't be coy.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't be coy
about things like that.

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
So my thing is,
let's just do it.

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:17.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, like, you know, hopefully
after a couple of minutes,

00:04:17.557 --> 00:04:20.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
people will stop
checking you out.

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:21.361 line:92%
And I think the thing is,

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:23.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you're coy
and sort of do a little towel,

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
it makes people more like,
"Oh, I saw a flash!"

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:28.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you're going to get
more than a flash.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:29.736 size:75% position:38% line:92%
All the way through.

00:04:29.736 --> 00:04:32.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
At one point, I have to run --
We're in the pool.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:34.207 size:88% position:44%
And I have to lift him.
We're naked in the pool.

00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:37.410
And I have to lift him up.
And he is, like, a big boy.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:40.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
And lift him up and go
over the steps, like that.

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:44.517
And carry him and then sit down
and then spank him with a shoe.

